  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Election Process and Reforms and Support to Civil Society in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action aims to ensure that people in Lebanon benefit from strengthened elected and participative democracy and from a vibrant civil society (overall objective). The Action will contribute to democratic consolidation through the enhancement of the capacity of national stakeholders to conduct periodical, credible, transparent and inclusive elections in Lebanon; as well as to support the Lebanese authorities to prepare and adopt reform measures through the implementation of some of the key EU Election Observation Mission (EOM) 2022 priority recommendations. In parallel, the Action will strength the role of civil society organisations in enhancing democratic participation and strengthening social cohesion and `the acceptance of others&#xBF;.</narrative>
  </description>
